Gene IGHD3-10
=============

Known germline alleles:

- 3 known alleles:
    IGHD3-10*01: 31 nucleotides
    IGHD3-10*02: 30 nucleotides
    IGHD3-10*03: 31 nucleotides

- Alleles IGHD3-10*01 and IGHD3-10*03 differ at position 16:

    pos            16
    ----------     --
    IGHD3-10*01     G
    IGHD3-10*03     A

- Allele IGHD3-10*03 is obtained by deleting 12th nucleotide (G) from
